    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Hi, I'd like to implement the four parametric quantile methods: weibull, hazen, median_unbiased, and normal_unbiased.\nSince these all use the same formula (i - \u03b1) / (n - \u03b1 - \u03b2 + 1) with different (\u03b1, \u03b2) constants, I plan to implement them together in a single PR.\nIs anyone currently working on these? If not, can I get started?",
